                                                "sense_id": "377e4bb4-995e-3b44-91ee-de82725a7170",
                                                "text": "Even more recently, The Times Literary Supplement, sifting through Hardy’s ashes, ran a story suggesting that his first wife may have suffered from quaternary neurosyphilis — contracted from him."
